1. A semiconductor device comprising:

a semiconductor body (100) comprising a main semiconductor structure having a p-n active layer sequence (110);

a plastic support substrate (200) having a first via (210) and a second via (220) extending therethrough;

a p-contact layer (310) and an n-contact layer (320) electrically connecting the main semiconductor structure (110) to the first via (210) and the second via (220), respectively; and

an electrostatic discharge (ESD) protection element (400) arranged between the plastic support substrate (200) and the semiconductor body (100), 

wherein the ESD protection element (400) is electrically connected anti-parallel to the main semiconductor structure (110).
